roms/rp2040/bootrom.bin is NOT Raspberry Pi bootrom content — it is a 16 KB
stub (initial SP + reset vector + `B .` filler) generated in-tree by
roms/rp2040/gen_blinky.py. No third-party attribution is required.

The other *.bin files under roms/ that are not listed below are likewise
generated by the adjacent gen_*.py scripts and carry the same license as
the rest of this repository.

